doogee-u10-nixos licensing
==========================

Unless stated otherwise, the files in this repository (Nix code, scripts,
documentation) are licensed under the MIT license:

  SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT

Exceptions:

  kernel/doogee-u10.fragment      GPL-2.0-or-later (kernel configuration)
  kernel/doogee-u10.config        generated from the Linux kernel's Kconfig,
                                  GPL-2.0

The kernel, U-Boot, rkbin and rk3562deb sources fetched at build time
(see sources.nix) keep their own licenses.

